{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "22a9756ac40170b3e086b6e3ad9e889c46c93012178db2c21708be9c74fb04d2", "ja": "それが『BIRTH』！", "zh": "这就是『BIRTH』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0f91aafe2ed10c4b15ee60a78e70ed2bed96d6ecf3a7add5d62fe1142d0e211d", "ja": "本番直前なのに、ユニットの方向性を決めて\nいなかったと気付く5人。カッコイイ派の歩\nとカワイイ派の真が互いに主張する中、プロ\nデューサーの『カッコカワイイ』でみんなが\n納得。いよいよ公演の幕が上がる！", "zh": "五人在正式登台前才发觉尚未决定团体路线。\n步主张帅气，真主张可爱，两人各执己见。\n此时，制作人提出的『帅气可爱』路线，\n得到团内所有成员的认同。\n于是，公演终于要揭开序幕了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a37f583fd20bd744b5b637bdc8c47b2fa7322ba77cf3b80a209ceda773431d88", "ja": "（いよいよ、BIRTHの公演の幕が開く。\n今日までみんな、精一杯練習してきた。あとは……）", "zh": "（『BIRTH』的公演终于要揭幕了。\n大家已经拚命练习到今天，再来只要……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "365ffa9b435f832b946d8b90392e9ee7823ae8872f3dd46d68142b41dd17a313", "ja": "{$P$}、どうしよ～！？　もうすぐ\n本番だと思ったら、急に緊張してきちゃったよ～……！", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么办～！？\n我一想到要正式登台，突然就好紧张喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e01332e0190a32c3a6dbccc50733c0cb44e82e474a1aec55d2cc2878593b747e", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だよ、歩ちゃん！　みんな、あんなに\n練習したんだから。練習どおりにやれば、きっと……。", "zh": "放、放心吧，小步！大家都练习了那么多次，\n只要照着练习的方式表演，一定没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "551f039f00eb8b6f2933f6e6fe078a3944d287d559d45e8c7e177a4f83e79d67", "ja": "歩、雪歩の言う通りだぞ！\n大丈夫、練習どおりにやればいいだけだ。", "zh": "步，雪步说得没错！\n放心，只要照着练习来就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "d7a67e3dd02237007bfeff29d33755aba4d6d1ebba26f214d459da129c80c5cb", "ja": "そうだよ、歩！\n今は、ステージを楽しむことだけ考えよう！", "zh": "没错，步！\n现在只要想着等等要开心表演就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "2d71e81bbe21e1a5c40e7dff4073e29b5f4599d417e36ddf5f629530139b2a69", "ja": "あとは、そうだね。BIRTHらしく……。", "zh": "再来嘛，就是拿出『BIRTH』的风格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "b172e921b4581d80a7b2c0ae43548f4b109c85e06f367305bdfc377009b9de49", "ja": "カワイく（カッコよく）決めるだけ！", "zh": "展现出可爱（帅气）的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "148fd8b48502b4a237a582c230708f2eb4cf7720871d916c0162c5d4b093acec", "ja": "カッコよく決めるだけ！", "zh": "展现出帅气的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "142f64d11ccfe94c672e60418267108c903dadfd480a2bf6f247cd51f3e89ce8", "ja": "……はれっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "8da82d2eb1168a6da456195163b39e48eea679944a80a3cd4c9ce543a51e207f", "ja": "あ、あらあら～。", "zh": "哎、哎呀哎呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "c288769b15dbd4773858a84174c87a3fa536c068a52638ad666eeb69c00508b7", "ja": "そ、そういえば、ユニットの方向性って、\n結局決めてないままだったっけ……。", "zh": "这、这么说起来，\n我们最后好像一直没有决定团体路线……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3cd4017c6fe08330f825183ee6176ca6e40a7015b0d545e8e217c813b040fce3", "ja": "ええっ！？　最強ダンスユニットなんだから、\nカッコイイでキマリだろ！？", "zh": "什么！？\n我们是最强舞团，当然要帅气才对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "820f5c25796770ebb5b445ec7c2146a1cf39ecc6032e44e348aa85da3817507e", "ja": "いや、そんなことないよ！　やっぱりアイドルだし、\nカワイイ心を忘れちゃいけないと思う！", "zh": "不对，才没这回事！\n我们毕竟是偶像，不能忘记保持可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8c5bf2fce89223bdd6189c9e44844e1c15f42a9190b65c99f70edef8301978cc", "ja": "いやいやいや！　カッコイイじゃないと、\nせっかくのダンスがもったいないって！", "zh": "不对不对不对！\n要是不表现出帅气，不就枉费我们练了这支舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "c5338508b2640af25d2f83f3a8d93522c0d1b1bf6b37efd1074806996797b2ad", "ja": "で、でも！　ボクはカワイくなりたくて\nアイドルになったんだから、やっぱり……！", "zh": "但、但是！在下成为偶像是想变得可爱，\n所以在下还是觉得……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "8bcec274329b52c47d0c516337b9cdebdb632184045f086770b41f418cc8ad55", "ja": "あわわわわ……\n{$P$}さん、どうしましょう～！？", "zh": "啊哇哇哇哇……\n{$P$}先生，这下怎么办～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ede4eb636994e08f74991fac8f5389520f59d6fe4897be1843911c4a402362c9", "ja": "そうだな……じゃあ、ここは俺が決めよう。\n真、歩。BIRTHのコンセプトは……。", "zh": "这个嘛……那就由我来决定吧。\n真、步，『BIRTH』的主题是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_1017", "source_sha256": "6ecfc3c910a4b338cd60ec03fe1d73af4bba9bc5fc0e69761fc63f1edf410e9e", "ja": "カッコカワイイ！", "zh": "帅气可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "873b8aa1b6ff7b1b5c21e9f0341f97263dbcebbac8370a1218ee674b3d6c71bd", "ja": "『カッコカワイイ』だ！\nどうだ？　これなら文句ないだろう？", "zh": "『帅气可爱』！\n怎么样？这样你们就没有怨言了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aa64a72b0973c6236a25e25df09e62d23a5db6763a1d617310c2902eab95ef7a", "ja": "か、カッコカワイイ？\n{$P$}、何言って……。", "zh": "帅、帅气可爱？\n{$P$}，你在说什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2002_006mak", "source_sha256": "c44239f0c0a2cc71acdf2b654921bc19e839ae98d661840e3c9748f2ead8c93a", "ja": "それだ！　それですよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "没错！就是这个，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c8398abed5cdccb578d3dd5f47a78edcb0a33240268432658c054ca83df9e596", "ja": "ええっ！？\nま、真まで、何言い出すんだよ～。", "zh": "什么！？\n连、连真都跟着胡言乱语～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2004_006mak", "source_sha256": "a914d934cf7b4e0102c565c60455e1226a8ed1a17a082ff6baa070547b0f6dba", "ja": "ふざけてるわけじゃないよ、歩。でもボクは、\nカッコイイもカワイイも、あきらめたくない！", "zh": "步，在下可不是在开玩笑喔。\n不管是帅气或可爱，在下都不想放弃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2005_010azu", "source_sha256": "a1feadb0dfe78823e64b6eea8347082768a904e94b7503e8e0bf4ef43d9adf12", "ja": "うふふ、そうね。カッコイイとカワイイの両方を\nいいとこ取り……いいんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "唔呵呵，这么说也对。\n融合帅气与可爱两方的优点……这样不是很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2006_036kan", "source_sha256": "7c2c153d64bd4412023f49f284b1d1d9254779745727f340a5eb6ac39d7c8ffa", "ja": "カッコイイとカワイイのいいとこ取り……\nなんだか欲ばりですね！", "zh": "融合帅气与可爱的优点……\n感觉好贪心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e50579547f1fa31e4edc8c2030802668afa3656d9316ff8727c3f7d845ff7d0a", "ja": "わ、私、どっちも自信はないけど……\nみんなの足を引っぱらないように、頑張りますぅ！", "zh": "虽、虽然我在这两方面都没有自信……\n但我会努力不扯大家的后腿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2008_p", "source_sha256": "7803c5069702fc3b816150c39e76d1abc1a7535947ebe255bdd40be54e1e2790", "ja": "どうだ？　歩。まだ難しいと思うか？", "zh": "怎么样，步？你还是担心有困难吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d4b783ee6a7b007c3a3d9758b1a133490faa963eb055a1de403f8b981b07a1d8", "ja": "も～……みんなには敵わないな！\nOK、わかったよ！", "zh": "真是的……真拿你们没办法！\nOK，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8cdb5690044a54052a3d7856899f926cdb6726ff6b875eae3d3167afb23651de", "ja": "それじゃ、本番ではカッコカワイイを意識して\nやってみよう！　みんな、ヨロシク！", "zh": "那在正式登台后，试着展现出帅气可爱吧！\n大家，拜托你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2011_006mak", "source_sha256": "fe6f8021bc887bdf6d85082604b0d5ce4b53e24a73f5e1b069a6d3fc67fd14ee", "ja": "OK！　それじゃ、円陣組むよ！\nほら、歩、{$P$}も！", "zh": "OK！那来围成一个圈吧！\n快来吧，步！还有{$P$}也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2012_p", "source_sha256": "44f8edc84bf10dde076beea5b49d5bb31dd26e1d7631a250e7a683c56b5c98f0", "ja": "お、俺もか？\n……よし、わかった。じゃあ一緒に！", "zh": "我、我也要吗？\n……好，我知道了。那我也一起吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2013_006mak", "source_sha256": "734967a5aaf609e7201924c1afbb85cfc16c99da0a6ecdd0dd5947794c0dbbd3", "ja": "それじゃあみんな……行くよ！\nBIRTH、レディ……。", "zh": "那么大家……要喊口号啰！\n『BIRTH』，Ready……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_06_2014_006mak", "source_sha256": "eb5317c0c2c2423ce58108ce18e6372779c61cef0206a870c37826bc39e80129", "ja": "ゴー！！！！", "zh": "Go！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
